        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "title": "How to read the kingdom",
          "text": "Five practical places, an arrival-road gateway, and two imagined realms point to the chapters ahead. Their pin numbers identify map locations, not page order."
        },
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "title": "Eight landmarks",
          "text": "Gathering Hall · Workshop · Expedition Dock · Archive · Commons · Queen Raida · Moloch · Arrival Road. Their map pins identify places, not a reading order."
        },
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "title": "Two realms",
          "text": "Queen Raida helps surface context and draft next steps while people exercise judgment. Moloch names a coordination failure: shared ownership, useful tools, and cooperation help people avoid outcomes nobody wants."
        }
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "overview",
        "prism"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "joining-plate",
      "sectionId": "joining",
      "layout": "full-art",
      "eyebrow": "THE JOURNEY",
      "title": "Your path into the Guild",
      "intro": "An illustrated route from first contact to active membership.",
      "art": {
        "assetId": "joining",
        "crop": [
          0,
          0,
          1,
          1
        ]
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "text": "Concept art contains baked-in captions. Read the next page and the live handbook for editable, current guidance."
        }
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "joining"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "joining-steps",
      "sectionId": "joining",
      "layout": "steps",
      "eyebrow": "THE ROUTE",
      "title": "Seven stops, separate approvals",
      "intro": "Cohort graduation and full membership Championing are distinct decisions.",
      "art": {
        "assetId": "joining",
        "crop": [
          0.02,
          0.1,
          0.58,
          0.72
        ]
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "title": "Find the Guild",
              "text": "Create a Portal profile and join Discord. Start with either door.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "title": "Join a cohort",
              "text": "Signal interest in Portal and complete the cohort’s learning and workshops.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "title": "Demo and graduate",
              "text": "An accepted Demo Day submission leads to cohort graduate or apprentice status.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "title": "Contribute",
              "text": "Build trust through Raids, RIPs, meetings, and Guild life.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "title": "Find a Champion",
              "text": "A current member other than your cohort host speaks for you at Raider Roundtable.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "6",
              "title": "Membership proposal",
              "text": "Submit and complete the onchain proposal under current governance settings.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "7",
              "title": "Make it your Guild",
              "text": "Participate in governance and activate resources through their current processes.",
              "sourceIds": [
                "joining"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "title": "Before paid work",
          "text": "LLC registration and light KYC are required before receiving paid Raid compensation. This is separate from DAO membership."
        }
      ],
      "sourceIds": [
        "joining",
        "apprentice",
        "member",
        "paid"
      ]
    },
